--- !u!114 &1791258587
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1791258585}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3c765a47d49e40b45805f6c526f6afbe, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Acrophobia.Narration.NarratorDirector
  _cues:
  - Id: wake
    Trigger: 1
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He woke up. Same room, different floor. They do move him, eventually.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: door_first
    Trigger: 2
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: And there it is. Nothing between him and all that air but a decision he
      already made.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: door_closed
    Trigger: 3
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He closed it again. That is allowed. It is, in fact, the entire point that
      it is allowed.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 0
  - Id: first_down
    Trigger: 4
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He looked down. Deliberately. That is further than most people get on a
      first morning.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: avoid
    Trigger: 8
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He has been studying that wall with real commitment. The wall is fine.
      It will hold.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 0
  - Id: still
    Trigger: 9
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He stood very still, as though the building might not notice him.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 5.5
    OnceOnly: 0
  - Id: retreat
    Trigger: 7
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: He stepped back. Good. Stepping back is how he gets to step forward again
      later.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 0
  - Id: step_back
    Trigger: 6
    TierFilter: 0
    Line: Down a floor. Not a defeat. A sensible man descends before he insists.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 0
  - Id: tier2
    Trigger: 5
    TierFilter: 2
    Line: A desk this time. Twelve metres. He has sat higher than this and thought
      nothing of it.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: tier3
    Trigger: 5
    TierFilter: 3
    Line: Thirty metres, and the platform moves a little. It is supposed to. It was
      built to.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: tier4
    Trigger: 5
    TierFilter: 4
    Line: Sixty. The walkway is narrower here. His feet already know this; it is
      his stomach that needs telling.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 6.5
    OnceOnly: 1
  - Id: top
    Trigger: 10
    TierFilter: 5
    Line: The roof. No room to go back into this time. Only the city, and him, and
      however long he wants.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    HoldSeconds: 7
    OnceOnly: 1
  _avoidanceNoticeSeconds: 9
  _avoidanceThreshold: 0.72
  _stillnessNoticeSeconds: 25
  _stillnessSpeedThreshold: 0.06
  _minimumGapSeconds: 2.5
  _subtitles: {fileID: 149718944}
  _voiceSource: {fileID: 1791258586}
  _fsm: {fileID: 1222598477}
  _door: {fileID: 1355217016}
  _gaze: {fileID: 1341198557}
  _edge: {fileID: 1341198556}
  _retreat: {fileID: 1700667858}
  _logger: {fileID: 1700667860}
