--- !u!114 &1791258590
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1791258585}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4584b2b2635da964ab24563c142765ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Acrophobia.Narration.RitualSequencer
  _rituals:
  - Label: Bedroom morning
    Beats:
    - Kind: 0
      Line: He woke up. Same room as last time, though they had moved it up a few
        floors since.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: Water running. The ordinary business of a face being washed.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 4.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: Two minutes of brushing, which he did properly, because he always does.
      Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed83454173e80694d83ae56d4fc05302, type: 3}
      Seconds: 7
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: Coffee, poured badly, drunk standing up - the way people do when they
        are putting something off.
      Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39fea28acadf5d24f824790b9133d5dd, type: 3}
      Seconds: 6
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 4
      Line: 
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 1
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Line: The light through the window was doing something worth looking at. He
        noticed. That is the whole trick, really - noticing.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 6.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
  - Label: Office morning
    Beats:
    - Kind: 0
      Line: A desk this time. Twelve metres up, which is nothing, which he knows,
        which does not help.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: Three emails that could have waited, and a room full of people who are
        not here.
      Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff485b4384af69f46842b5153c059bb2, type: 3}
      Seconds: 7
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: Coffee again, worse than yesterday's. He drank it anyway.
      Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39fea28acadf5d24f824790b9133d5dd, type: 3}
      Seconds: 5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 4
      Line: 
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 0.8
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Line: The window was right there. It had been right there the whole time.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
  - Label: Plant room
    Beats:
    - Kind: 0
      Line: Thirty metres. A room full of machinery that hums and asks nothing of
        him.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: A gauge checked, a number written down. Honest work.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 4
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 4
      Line: 
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 0.8
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Line: The access door was open a crack, and the light coming through it was
        very good.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
  - Label: Stairwell landing
    Beats:
    - Kind: 0
      Line: Sixty. He took the stairs, which took a while, which was fine.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Line: A long way up, one step at a time.
      Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a920c601697bca745b6954e80b0fc080, type: 3}
      Seconds: 8
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 4
      Line: 
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 0.8
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Line: One more door. He has opened four of these now, and the building has
        not once dropped him.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 6
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
  - Label: Terrace
    Beats:
    - Kind: 0
      Line: The roof. No routine for this one. No kettle, no desk, no door to close
        behind him.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 6
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 4
      Line: 
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 1
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Line: Only the city, and him, and as long as he wants.
      Clip: {fileID: 0}
      Seconds: 5.5
      Marker: {fileID: 0}
      Radius: 1
      TimeoutSeconds: 45
      Prop: {fileID: 0}
      PropActive: 1
      LockMovement: 0
